{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_900a436f047a","title":"集智俱乐部","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA==&mid=2247738554&idx=1&sn=d3536d2c9e42312e17310d01eba2e945&chksm=e98e17aab24635f11b42fd374d322ced5d18e3a508489a630b8eb90c2bd2a401647da69e7a28&scene=126&sessionid=1795529056#rd","description":"关注复杂科学与人工智能的前沿进展、书籍资料、工具文献、交叉前沿等，同时也发布集智俱乐部、集智学园举办的各类讲座、课程等活动相关信息。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"集智俱乐部","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM4VicMW8sROy4mp4kicsCbgPdujTibKFkG2AUMQt9uwRZ5pA%2F0","updated":"2026-11-24T06:30:00.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA%3D%3D:2247738554:1","title":"生物信息学简报：⽹络药理学——迈向基于⼈⼯智能的精准中医药","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA==&mid=2247738554&idx=1&sn=d3536d2c9e42312e17310d01eba2e945&chksm=e98e17aab24635f11b42fd374d322ced5d18e3a508489a630b8eb90c2bd2a401647da69e7a28&scene=126&sessionid=1795529056#rd","description":"从一剂方药到一张网络，AI如何定位中药靶点","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FqZtAVROIcHQ8XOqCnpmnvELkMxjWE6kBx74JLoO8b5sypyrbTkDF9ocOjURYOn7zQ1C3oxE7kDdgNVudKCrG9r593PbZ4bictqra3woy9ibJA%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T06:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA%3D%3D:2247738553:1","title":"科学前沿：对称性引导的层级化涌现与抽象","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIzMjQyNzQ5MA==&mid=2247738553&idx=1&sn=27af5d5fafbc42b3788860a00c447608&chksm=e9f6aa9ef2f2541ea1c7c2a93ff2e02c387bc3cabd04a9e0055edb3a0a249cf232b2d6d71ef3&scene=126&sessionid=1795529056#rd","description":"从字母识别到疫情监测，对称性如何决定哪些信息值得保留","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FqZtAVROIcHQUgj0umr76xodWZxSyIsoYdIefCPYYbxZIgJYaCEwvichzjU6hlIj3EQibr9qAsPZmpibQXU5wBTEmIB7aATWLfGUvIq4Ctg